2026-08-13: Iteration 3 verified that run_0009 is already selected `final` through the supported campaign flow and that its archived validation/test SHA-256 values are `ede536cf338713b2d7e9f64a6bcb03a57c55d537f97393826a1e7724b16bd852` and `348bb8e8f9b894189a8c00ccb0f76d638e73c9c77c78aa180dff1c10a565931a`. Proposed the pre-origin PubMed/Europe PMC publication-evidence branch and revised the time allocation around its origin-specific retrieval cache.
