2026-08-13: Publication provenance — PubMed ESearch/EFetch base `https://eutils.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/eutils`, query `(<NCT>[si] OR ...) AND (1800/01/01[pdat] : <origin-1d>[pdat])`; Europe PMC base `https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search`, query `ACCESSION_ID:<NCT> AND FIRST_PDATE:[1800-01-01 TO <origin-1d>]`, `resultType=core`. Retrieval occurred 2026-08-13T20:10:00Z–20:31:42Z at 182–212 trials/minute. Independent eligibility accepts a complete electronic/first-publication date strictly before origin or a year-only date strictly before origin year; zero violations were found across 11,451 admissible origin-specific records. Citation counts, current corrections, post-origin documents, current registry summaries, and later activity are excluded; only point-in-time AACT context from the already-audited pre-origin snapshots is provided to adjudication.
